Updating from upstream
----------------------
1. Clone https://github.com/keepkey/trezor-firmware
2. Checkout the target commit
3. diff -r trezor-firmware/crypto/ deps/crypto/ --exclude=VENDORED_FROM \
        --exclude=CMakeLists.txt
4. Copy changed files, update this commit hash, rebuild and test
